     5	diagrams, charts, knowledge VQA, long captions). Output rows match the agent dataset schema
     6	(images: [Image], messages: [{role, content, reasoning_content}]) with NO agent system prompt,
     7	so the model keeps answering normally outside the agent prompt.
     8	
     9	Usage (on the GPU VM): python build_general_replay.py --out /content/data/replay --n 12000
