+            - `'pt'`: Return PyTorch `torch.Tensor` objects.
+            - `'np'`: Return NumPy `np.ndarray` objects.
+    """
+
+    text_pair: TextInput | PreTokenizedInput | list[TextInput] | list[PreTokenizedInput] | None
